                <pb facs="0263" n="157" xml:id="pg157"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hicks to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago, Chile</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-08-22">August 22,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Anxiety over earthquake decreases, although mild shocks still continue; financial
                    and business situation quite serious, and destruction of Valparaiso produces
                    fear of panic; subscriptions raised for relief of sufferers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hicks.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
